Balance Changes:

- Greg
-> HP 800 -> 1100
-> DPS 100 -> 120 
Why: Suppliers aren't the Squaddies who have a lot of HP or damage. These buffs should make Greg  more decent

- Chicken
-> HP 650 -> 1000 
-> DPS 100 -> 110 
Why: Chicken was pretty weak compared to other Squaddies. This should help Chicken fit in the current meta

- Colt
-> HP 400 -> 1200 
-> DPS 200 -> 220 
Why: Colt is pretty fragile, add the slow unload speed and low DPS and this makes him bad. These buffs should make him better for sure.

- Medic
-> HP 600 -> 1250 
-> DPS 100 -> 110 
Why: Medic will be a pretty decent Healer with these buffs!

- Dynamike
-> HP 500 -> 1100 
-> DPS 95 -> 110 
Why: Dynamike is also going to be better with these buffs

- El Primo
-> DPS 100 -> 110 
Why: A small buff to Primo to fit better

- Witch
-> HP 650 -> 1150 
-> DPS 230 -> 200
-> Attack speed -20%
Why: Witch has a really fast attack speed combined with her ability to spawn skeletons and high damage makes her almost unstoppable. These nerfs should tone her down!

Aaaand with this all Squaddies are rebalanced! Stay tuned because we will rebalance character abilities next!

QoL changes:

-> Changed "Diamonds, Gems and Elixir" to "SPECIALS!" So the text can look bigger in-game
-> Changed OpenSquad special to OS: Reborn special for Barbarian's skins
-> Changed lobby camera angle (because of the recent community vote)
-> Changed menu music and loading jingle
-> Changed Quest type and reward
-> Changed all OpenSquad references to OpenSquad: Reborn

Texture improvements:

- Magical Shelly
- Hero Battle Healer
